    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi especialidad es curar Pokémon. Por eso\ndecidí enseñarles eso a los míos también.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor algo trabajo en el Centro Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"¿Cómo?\", te preguntarás... Bueno...\n¡Les enseñé movimientos que restauran PS!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Llegó la hora de combatir contra mi equipo\nespecializado en curación. ¿Qué me dices?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres un combate Pokémon, ven y avísame.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007100750069006500720065007300200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C002000760065006E0020007900200061007600ED00730061006D0065002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres combatir contra mi equipo especializado\nen curación?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E0074007200610020006D0069002000650071007500690070006F00200065007300700065006300690061006C0069007A00610064006F000A0065006E002000630075007200610063006900F3006E003F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F00720020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no crees poder vencerme, está bien que seas\nprudente esta vez.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F00200063007200650065007300200070006F006400650072002000760065006E006300650072006D0065002C002000650073007400E10020006200690065006E002000710075006500200073006500610073000A00700072007500640065006E0074006500200065007300740061002000760065007A002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate para sentir la desesperación de ver a tu\nrival curarse cuando pensabas que el combate ya<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nestaba terminado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué poder sin igual! ¡Y qué tenacidad tan\nimponente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E900200070006F006400650072002000730069006E00200069006700750061006C0021002000A1005900200071007500E9002000740065006E006100630069006400610064002000740061006E000A0069006D0070006F006E0065006E00740065002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sé que no basta con curar a los Pokémon.\nPor eso elegí otros movimientos también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque no estuve a tu altura, lo reconozco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E0071007500650020006E006F00200065007300740075007600650020006100200074007500200061006C0074007500720061002C0020006C006F0020007200650063006F006E006F007A0063006F002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero yo trabajo en el Centro Pokémon!\n¡Mi especialidad es curar a los Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que, si no te importa, atenderé a mis\nPokémon de inmediato.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED0020007100750065002C0020007300690020006E006F00200074006500200069006D0070006F007200740061002C0020006100740065006E00640065007200E9002000610020006D00690073000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200064006500200069006E006D00650064006900610074006F002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se me hace raro curar a mi propio equipo\nen el Centro Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650020006D0065002000680061006300650020007200610072006F002000630075007200610072002000610020006D0069002000700072006F00700069006F002000650071007500690070006F000A0065006E00200065006C002000430065006E00740072006F00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"¡Mi equipo recobró toda su energía!\".\nJe, je.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002200A1004D0069002000650071007500690070006F0020007200650063006F0062007200F300200074006F0064006100200073007500200065006E00650072006700ED006100210022002E000A004A0065002C0020006A0065002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si vienes aquí, curaré a tus Pokémon encantada!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
